{"synopsis":"Sebuah acara dadakan untuk serial \"fantasi modern\" yang sangat kusukai sampai aku rela menggunakan cuti tahunanku yang berharga untuk pergi.\n\nDan hari itu, aku berpindah ke dunia fantasi modern tersebut.\n\nSebagai karyawan baru yang baru saja mendapatkan pekerjaan di sebuah perusahaan besar ternama!\n\nPekerjaan impian dengan tunjangan yang bagus, gaji yang tinggi, dan bahkan atasan langsung yang baik dan cakap.\n\nDengan pengetahuan tentang dunia fantasi yang hanya kumiliki, aku terus dipromosikan dengan kecepatan kilat!\n\nApakah aku bahagia?\n\nTolong kirim aku pulang. Kumohon.","alternative_title":"괴담에 떨어져도 출근을 해야 하는구나","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"ch_28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"ch_27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"ch_26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"ch_25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"ch_24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"ch_23","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"ch_22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"ch_21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"ch_20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"ch_19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"ch_18","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"ch_17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"ch_16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-0